title: An Attempt on a Senator's Life
subtitle: Someone is trying to silence the Caucus.
tags: event
view-if: evidence >= 5 and grand_plan >= 40 and assassination_timer <= 0 and not finale and assassination_roll < 0.35
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_shadow.svg
on-arrival: {!
Q.assassination_timer = 8;
var protectedBy = Q.investigators_protected ? 0.35 : 0;
Q.assassin_hit = Math.random() < 0.55 - protectedBy ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.assassin_hit) { Q.investigators_lost += 1; Q.evidence -= 1; Q.capital -= 1; Q.fear += 2; }
else { Q.evidence += 0.8; Q.senate_resolve += 0.5; }
!}

= An Attempt on a Senator's Life

A bounty hunter fires into the speeder of one of our senior investigators. [? if assassin_hit : He does not survive. His files on the Chancellery's finances burn with him. ?][? if not assassin_hit : [? if investigators_protected : A Jedi Knight's lightsaber turns the bolt aside. ?][? if not investigators_protected : He survives by sheer luck. ?] The captured assassin, before she dies of a poisoned dart, gasps that she was hired "through a Muun". ?]
